    <title>Thank You, Now What? How Donors Respond to Calls to Action</title>
    <updated>2026-10-23T00:00:00+00:00</updated>
    <author>
      <name>K. Sudhir, Hortense Fong, Yonat Zwebner, Subroto Roy</name>
    </author>
    <content>&lt;b&gt;Marketing Science&lt;/b&gt; &lt;br&gt;We study whether thank-you communications that charities send to past donors should include a call to action and show that the answer depends on whether the donor has already given in the current giving cycle.</content>
